cff-version: 1.5.0
message: "If Senerenai-HyperProbe contributes to your work, please cite this repository."
title: "Senerenai-HyperProbe: Interpretable LLM Sampling Benchmark and Tuner"
type: software
version: 1.11.5
date-released: 2026-08-18
abstract: >-
  A lightweight, provider-neutral benchmark and tuner for sampling parameters
  of large language models exposed through OpenAI-compatible APIs, using an
  quality-first main-effect, targeted-interaction, holdout-validation, and stability workflow with strict cross-stage search-design provenance and adaptive confirmation of informative Stage 1 candidates, plus optional refusal/companion and long-context retrieval diagnostics.
repository-code: "https://github.com/korodexios/senerenai-hyperprobe"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - large-language-models
  - sampling
  - benchmark
  - model-evaluation
  - multilingual
  - openai-compatible
  - python
  - long-context
  - refusal-evaluation
authors:
  - family-names: "Senerenai-HyperProbe contributors"
    given-names: ""
